@startuml
!include _theme.iuml

title C4 Deployment — Baseline executável observada (P5)
left to right direction

C4Person(operator, "Developer / operator", "Executa jornadas, consulta métricas, traces e evidências de CI.")

node "Developer Workstation / GitHub Actions\n[Docker Compose]" as environment {
  node "Runtime Zone" as runtime {
    artifact "Vertical Slice\n[FastAPI modular service]" as api
    artifact "OPA\n[Policy Decision Point]" as opa
    database "SQLite volume\n[Synthetic case state]" as sqlite
  }

  node "Observability Zone" as observability {
    artifact "OpenTelemetry Collector" as otel
    artifact "Prometheus" as prometheus
    artifact "Jaeger" as jaeger
    artifact "Grafana" as grafana
  }

  artifact "Eval Runner\n[Versioned dataset + thresholds]" as evals
  artifact "Evidence Artifacts\n[JSON, Markdown, E2E log]" as evidence
}

operator --> api : executa jornada sintética
operator --> grafana : consulta dashboards
operator --> jaeger : investiga traces
api --> opa : autorização HTTP / fail-closed
api --> sqlite : estado, timeline e idempotência
api ..> otel : spans OTLP
api ..> prometheus : endpoint /metrics
otel --> jaeger : traces OTLP
prometheus --> api : scrape
prometheus --> grafana : métricas e alertas
jaeger --> grafana : datasource de traces
evals --> evidence : relatório e gate
evals ..> api : compartilha funções determinísticas

note bottom of environment
Baseline local com dados sintéticos.
Sem documento real, OCR real, LLM real ou efeito financeiro.
end note
@enduml
